      "cwe_id": "CWE-862",
      "explanation": "The change restricts the ViewSet to read-only operations (by inheriting ReadOnlyModelViewSet) while explicitly retaining the DestroyModelMixin. This is a standard pattern to allow DELETE operations while preventing CREATE, UPDATE, and PATCH. It does not remove any existing authorization checks or introduce new endpoints without permission checks. The authorization logic is typically handled by the `permission_classes` or `get_permissions` methods which are not modified in this diff.",
